# icon-life.px - HUD life icon
# canvas 9x10, 1 frame. Simplified player interceptor (faces up): nose, cyan canopy, canards,
# delta wing, two nacelle stubs. Odd width so the fuselage is one centre column (x=4).
# light: top-left (left half one step lighter). K exterior outline.
# smallest must-read feature: cyan canopy 1x2 + the delta/canard silhouette.
# anchor: frame centre.
